      "content": "thanks for the info. i see what u mean about the \"one person, one vote\" thing. but i'm a bit confused, i keep hearing people say that the system was actually designed this way on purpose to help maintain the balance between the states so the big states don't just run everything. is that just an excuse people use, or is there actually a valid logic to that view?",
